  author    = "Laha, Antu and Yoshida, Suguru and Marques dos Santos Vieira,
               Francisco and Yi, Hemian and Lee, Seng Huat and Ayyagari, Sai
               Venkata Gayathri and Guan, Yingdong and Min, Lujin and Gonzalez
               Jimenez, Jose and Miao, Leixin and Graf, David and Sarker,
               Saugata and Xie, Weiwei and Alem, Nasim and Gopalan, Venkatraman
