              reaction is completed within 15 min at room temperature.
              Synchrotron X-ray diffractometry and optical second harmonic
              generation at room temperature have revealed that this compound
              shows a high-temperature LiNbO3-type structure (space group: R3̅c)
              involving Li-Co antisite defects and A-site splitting along the c
