              based on hybrid Hartree-Fock density functional theory
              calculations. Co-L2,3 edge X-ray absorption spectroscopy, as well
              as bond valence sum analysis, has verified the divalent oxidation
              state of Co ions in the lithiated phase, suggesting that its
              composition is close to LiCoF3 (x ≈ 1). This compound exhibits a
              paramagnetic-to-antiferromagnetic transition at 36 K on cooling,
